<script>
/* ------------------------------------------------------------------
   Stape / GTM loader (container TTZRC24)
   Performance change: GTM no longer loads immediately on the first page.
   On the first page of a visit it loads on the first scroll, tap, key
   press or mouse move. It loads only once per page view.
   Later pages in the same session load it straight away.

   Trade-off: a visitor who never interacts with the first page is not
   tracked (mostly instant bounces).

   TO ADD A TIMER BACK: set rrUseTimer = true (loads after loadDelay ms
   even without interaction).
   TO FULLY REVERT: set rrPageVisitLimit = 1 (original value), which
   loads GTM immediately on every first page view.
------------------------------------------------------------------- */

function loadRR() {
